  "description": "xUnit v3 adapter for the Unified.Data.Tables conformance kit: derive from StorageConformanceTests (or one of the per-tier classes), return your store factory, and every scenario of Unified.Data.Tables.Conformance runs as its own test case. A capability the store does not expose and a declared leniency are reported as skipped tests with the reason. For xUnit v2, MSTest or NUnit, loop over the scenarios of the neutral package instead.",
